OL,3,GNEWSAStatue of lifeguard to be
OL,4,Ainstalled on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bronze statue of a lifeguard is set
OL,7,Fto be installed on a beach to
OL,8,Fcommemorate the 25th anniversary of the
OL,9,FRNLI lifeguard service.
OL,11,FCornwall Council approved a planning
OL,12,Fapplication by the RNLI last week for
OL,13,Fthe commemorative work of art on the
OL,14,Frocky foreshore at Porthmeor beach, St
OL,15,FIves.
OL,17,FThe bronze sculpture by Zennor-based
OL,18,Fartist Holly Bendall, entitled Let Not
OL,19,FThe Deep Swallow Me Up, shows a female
OL,20,FRNLI lifeguard standing watch over the
OL,21,Fsea.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
